---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: settings::draft::SettingsDraft · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_resource fill:#F8F4EE,stroke:#A5792C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: cyl, label: "**SettingsDraft**<br/>菜单独立编辑的草稿；音量可以临时预览，只<br/>有应用成功才替换已保存设置。" }
  class n0 node_resource
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**rebuild​_​page**<br/>来自ui ↗：只在页面结构或视口变化时重<br/>建；数值、提示与焦点变化保留现有滚动控<br/>件。" }
  class n1 node_system
  class n1 external_node
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**handle​_​requests**<br/>来自ui ↗：每帧只消费一项语义请求，避免<br/>鼠标与确认键同时激活，或旧页面动作穿过页<br/>面切换。" }
  class n2 node_system
  class n2 external_node
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**publish​_​audio​_​preview**<br/>来自ui ↗：向音频功能发布或清除临时音量<br/>预览。" }
  class n3 node_system
  class n3 external_node
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update​_​settings​_​text**<br/>来自ui ↗：原位更新设置草稿数值与保存提<br/>示。" }
  class n4 node_system
  class n4 external_node
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update​_​volume​_​visuals**<br/>来自ui ↗：草稿由请求系统在 PreUpdate<br/>修改，随后同帧更新已有数字和轨道填充。" }
  class n5 node_system
  class n5 external_node
  n0 e0@--> n1
  class e0 edge_read
  n2 e1@-->|"可变访问"| n0
  class e1 edge_write
  n2 e2@-->|"赋值"| n0
  class e2 edge_write
  n0 e3@--> n3
  class e3 edge_read
  n0 e4@--> n4
  class e4 edge_read
  n0 e5@--> n5
  class e5 edge_read
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e1@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
  e3@{ curve: basis }
  e4@{ curve: basis }
  e5@{ curve: basis }
